WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,440
Sister, we all finished the transaction and returned. Who doesn’t want to take it?

2
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:06,560
If you don’t want to change, don’t agree when you told me you were going to starve to death.

3
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:09,080
You are not the one who was cheated. Of course you are not in a hurry.

4
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:11,600
Dugu Qiubai, it’s a shame that I admired you before

5
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,640
Your black-hearted approach will not last long.

6
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,310
Ding vehicle upgrade completed

7
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:19,110
Congratulations on becoming the first survivor in the region to upgrade a vehicle

8
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:22,710
Would you like to make a district-wide announcement?

9
00:00:22,710 --> 00:00:26,030
Congratulations to Dugu Qiubai for becoming the first survivor in the region to upgrade his vehicle.

10
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:27,590
Reward a mysterious gift package

11
00:00:27,590 --> 00:00:29,190
Please improve your strength as soon as possible

12
00:00:29,190 --> 00:00:30,910
The weak will only become weaker

13
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:33,220
Life and death, how could this happen?

14
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:35,040
Why is he so lucky?

15
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:36,680
Big old cow

16
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:39,440
Didn't some people just say that this approach won't go far?

17
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:41,440
As a result, they changed hands and the whole district was tied up.
